{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_title", "source_sha256": "1dc4d8d6c7a286a19d8c51c2caee61978505870296134049d7a720185cb954e6", "ja": "可奈とおでかけ1", "zh": "和可奈外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2f638171690c6781e6556439e1fe5bab3a342b62a78acfea28d4fb2a7aa55a3f", "ja": "可奈とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和可奈出门外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "10f478ad2d07247961ae87d1e209d64486b097c96d16389d77f46134895db77b", "ja": "（可奈が、軽井沢の商業施設でカラオケ大会に\nゲスト出演した。ナイスファイトだったぞ……！）", "zh": "（可奈在轻井泽的商业设施参加了卡拉OK大赛，作为嘉宾登场。表现得很棒啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "fcf8ae9cb7b9ee2d007e3e7f8a43e298671d9631163b9e38e2b31f981865fbf9", "ja": "うう～。可奈の歌、下手っぴかな～♪\n採点ちょっと、厳しかったな～♪　……はぁ。", "zh": "呜呜～。可奈唱得是不是很差劲呀～♪\n打分稍微有点严格了呢～♪　……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6b8c099708ec876a0fae03de9c0b823dd593fb6f174a9951ec28184d825a9f05", "ja": "可奈……そう落ち込まなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "可奈……不用那么消沉也没事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "478d4f667b7b149f9932d4db2447d12bb132d1f0fa791b961fc2f6bd1baec663", "ja": "でもでも、{$P$}さ～ん！\n私の十八番が、28点って～……はうぅ。", "zh": "可是可是，{$P$}先生！  \n我的拿手曲目居然只有28分～……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0ac050e1d09699e985810f7a160a399b88ff1bf84138f50ad256a028ecef3927", "ja": "たしかに点数は低かった。でも、自動採点っていうのは\nそういうものだし、大事なのは点数じゃないと思うぞ。", "zh": "确实，分数是低了点。不过自动评分就是这么回事，重要的不是分数。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3d813d7d18d35707be4df7d9db4044afc82cbdeef96add6ad59ae24886bd1fde", "ja": "可奈が歌った後、お客さんの拍手は一番大きかった！\nつまり、人の心を一番動かしたのは、可奈なんだ。", "zh": "可奈唱完之后，客人的掌声是最大的！\n也就是说，最能打动人心的是可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "9d89c63832119dea85838fbcbc009149008761152fc35887a878275f8a1f2038", "ja": "はっ……！\nそ、そうだったんですね！？", "zh": "哈……！\n原来是这样啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "32395c8cc62e4b9040d564bd4fecaa3aa6c4efcc27e8f4b0fcd127cd7d8f1f58", "ja": "可奈の～歌は～、下手っぴだけど～……\nひょっとして～、いい歌なのかも～♪", "zh": "可奈唱得～虽然～，很不擅长～……\n说不定～，也是首好歌呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6d2a2842915f131ab633528c76fc8157545cf636776dc119a56863764e2e1bb2", "ja": "うんうん、その調子だぞ、可奈！", "zh": "嗯嗯，就是这个劲头，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "0fa49fae569bbe84d25e5d240c50ff90e7c2263eacd896e3fe6ecbdf8e008736", "ja": "えへ♪　{$P$}さんのおかげで、\n元気が出ました！　ありがたいかな～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 多亏了{$P$}先生，\n我打起精神来了！真是太感谢了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_036kan01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_036kan01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "18a5284bae27e1825185c7b24da313ca963634e8cf7d228b7facf803be6ab268", "ja": "（下手かもしれないけど、真心は人一倍……そんな\n可奈の歌の魅力を、これからも届けていきたいな！）", "zh": "（或许唱得不够好，但这份真心远胜于他人……今后也要继续将可奈歌声的魅力传递下去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
